# Text is stored and checked out with LF on every machine. Windows' autocrlf
# would otherwise give a working tree of CRLF files, which php-cs-fixer (and the
# changelog test) reject; .editorconfig says LF as well.
* text=auto eol=lf

# What `composer create-project` and a release archive leave out.
#
# Only what belongs to this repository rather than to an application built from
# it. tests/, the tool configuration and docs/ stay: an application keeps
# `composer check`, autoload-dev scans tests/Fixtures/ and fails without it, and
# README.md links into docs/. CHANGELOG.md and UPGRADING.md stay too:
# framework:update prints the UPGRADING sections between two releases.
/.github        export-ignore
/.gitattributes export-ignore
/STABILITY.md   export-ignore
/LICENSE        export-ignore
